pmc:ChaosMagicCondBMirrorCrystalGazingTradition a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Mirror and crystal gazing tradition"@en, "Tradition des Spiegel- und Kristallschauens"@de ;
    skos:definition "Gazing into mirrors and crystals is described as a wide tradition, from the Americas and Africa to medieval Europe and ancient Greece, used to foretell and to speak with ancestral spirits; now and then scenes or beings are seen to leave the surface and blend into the room."@en ;
