pmc:ChaosMagicCondBInducingPropheticDreamsSpiritMeetings a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Inducing prophetic dreams and spirit meetings"@en, "Prophetische Träume und Geisterbegegnungen herbeiführen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Inducing prophetic dreams or dream meetings with spirits to discuss a particular problem; dreams as entry to the innerworlds."@en ;
