pmc:ChaosMagicCondBDreamtSmellManufacturedWaking a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Dreamt smell manufactured on waking"@en, "Erträumter Duft beim Erwachen hergestellt"@de ;
    skos:definition "A perfume-maker friend of Hine reports dreaming of a unique smell which she can analyse and reproduce on waking."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
