pmc:ChaosMagicCondBDrawingSleepSpare a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Drawing in sleep (Spare)"@en, "Im Schlaf zeichnen (Spare)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Spare is reported to have written that at times he woke to find himself before a completed picture that he had made while asleep."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:CondensedChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Condensed Chaos: An Introduction to Chaos Magic (Tempe: New Falcon, 1995, first edition, second printing 1996), ch. 4 Another Crack in the Wall, p. 74; read in a full-text layer of the second printing" .

pmp:ChaosMagicCondBKeepingDreamDiary a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Keeping a dream diary"@en, "Ein Traumtagebuch führen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Write down dreams, as soon after waking as possible; use the record to see how far dreams and waking life coincide and to pick out symbols, images and situations that return."@en ;
