pmc:ChaosMagicCondCMamaasuraNaming a pm:Naming ;
    rdfs:label "Mamaasura"@en, "Mamaasura"@de ;
    skos:definition "The demon of attachment, one of the obsessional demons that incarnations of Ganesha are said to have fought and subdued, as Hine reports from a Purana he names Upa Parana."@en ;
