pmc:ChaosMagicCondCMohaasuraNaming a pm:Naming ;
    rdfs:label "Mohaasura"@en, "Mohaasura"@de ;
    skos:definition "The demon of infatuation, one of the obsessional demons that incarnations of Ganesha are said to have fought and subdued, as Hine reports from a Purana he names Upa Parana."@en ;
    skos:note "The text announces eight incarnations of Ganesha but names seven demons; \"Upa Parana\" is printed so."@en ;
    pm:nameForm "Mohaasura" ;
    pm:nameRole "obsessional demon of infatuation, overcome by an incarnation of Ganesha" ;
